         "explanation": "Generate a smaller dataset and display it nicely. In the dataset, home_team and away_team are countries, and the Country column indicates where the match took place; it should coincide with the home_team.  Make sure there is: \n* A country that plays more at home than away.\n* A country that plays more away than at home. \n* A country that wins more home than away. \n\nDisplay the dataset nicely in readable form without using HTML. ",
